!experiments/registry.csv
!experiments/registry_baselines.csv

# Large model binaries -- do not commit, track provenance via configs/models.yaml instead
backend/model/*.safetensors
backend/model/training_args.bin
backend/model/tokenizer.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Restricted: files that embed raw review text (Arabic and/or English mixed).
# The English source (UCSD/McAuley) has no confirmed public redistribution
# license (see docs/data_availability.md / paper/notes/DATA_LICENSING_AND_RELEASE.md).
# These files are withheld from the public repository as a conservative measure,
# even where a given file is Arabic-only, because several of them interleave
# Arabic and English rows. Full versions remain available locally for this
# project's own reproducibility; ID-and-label-only companions (no "text" column)
# are committed instead wherever they already exist (e.g. completed_raw/*.csv,
# results/predictions/*.csv, results/human_gold_evaluation/*_metrics_*.csv).
# Not released pending clarification of the source dataset's redistribution status.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
